 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
 PROGRAM-ID. RPTS.
* REPORT's LISTR export on the screen (2026-11-11):
* SET PRINTER TO SCREEN, five customers.  Expect page
* 1 (AMY BOB CAL, TOTAL 250), Press a key, page 2
* (DEE EVE, a blank line, TOTAL 1257), END OF REPORT.
 DATA DIVISION.
 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
 01  CUST-NAME  PIC X(20).
 01  CUST-BAL   PIC 9(8).
 01  RPT-PAGE   PIC 999  VALUE ZERO.
 01  RPT-LINES  PIC 999  VALUE ZERO.
 01  RPT-DATE.
     05  RPT-YY  PIC XX.
     05  RPT-MM  PIC XX.
     05  RPT-DD  PIC XX.
 01  RPT-DATEP.
     05  RDP-MM  PIC XX.
     05  FILLER  PIC X  VALUE "/".
     05  RDP-DD  PIC XX.
     05  FILLER  PIC X  VALUE "/".
     05  RDP-YY  PIC XX.
 01  RT-09  PIC S9(14)  VALUE ZERO.
 01  RPT-L01.
     05  FILLER  PIC X(29)  VALUE SPACES.
     05  FILLER  PIC X(13)  VALUE "CUSTOMER LIST".
     05  FILLER  PIC X(27)  VALUE SPACES.
     05  R01-70  PIC ZZ9.
 01  RPT-L02.
     05  FILLER  PIC X(69)  VALUE SPACES.
     05  R02-70  PIC X(8).
 01  RPT-L03.
     05  FILLER  PIC X(4)  VALUE SPACES.
     05  FILLER  PIC X(4)  VALUE "NAME".
     05  FILLER  PIC X(21)  VALUE SPACES.
     05  FILLER  PIC X(7)  VALUE "BALANCE".
 01  RPT-L04.
     05  FILLER  PIC X(4)  VALUE SPACES.
     05  FILLER  PIC X(30)  VALUE "------------------------------".
     05  FILLER  PIC X(5)  VALUE "-----".
 01  RPT-L05.
     05  FILLER  PIC X(4)  VALUE SPACES.
     05  R05-05  PIC X(20).
     05  FILLER  PIC X(5)  VALUE SPACES.
     05  R05-30  PIC ZZZZZZZ9.
 01  RPT-L08.
     05  FILLER  PIC X(4)  VALUE SPACES.
     05  FILLER  PIC X(5)  VALUE "TOTAL".
     05  FILLER  PIC X(20)  VALUE SPACES.
     05  R08-30  PIC ZZZZZZZZZ9.
 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
 MAIN-PARA.
     SET PRINTER TO SCREEN.
     PERFORM RPT-BEGIN.
     MOVE "AMY" TO CUST-NAME. MOVE 50 TO CUST-BAL.
     PERFORM RPT-DETAIL.
     MOVE "BOB" TO CUST-NAME. MOVE 101 TO CUST-BAL.
     PERFORM RPT-DETAIL.
     MOVE "CAL" TO CUST-NAME. MOVE 99 TO CUST-BAL.
     PERFORM RPT-DETAIL.
     MOVE "DEE" TO CUST-NAME. MOVE 1000 TO CUST-BAL.
     PERFORM RPT-DETAIL.
     MOVE "EVE" TO CUST-NAME. MOVE 7 TO CUST-BAL.
     PERFORM RPT-DETAIL.
     PERFORM RPT-END.
     SET PRINTER TO PAPER.
     DISPLAY "END OF REPORT".
     STOP RUN.
 RPT-BEGIN.
     MOVE ZERO TO RPT-PAGE.
     MOVE ZERO TO RPT-LINES.
     MOVE ZERO TO RT-09.
     ACCEPT RPT-DATE FROM DATE.   
     MOVE RPT-MM TO RDP-MM.
     MOVE RPT-DD TO RDP-DD.
     MOVE RPT-YY TO RDP-YY.
     PERFORM RPT-HEAD.
 RPT-HEAD.
     DISPLAY ERASE UPON PRINTER.
     ADD 1 TO RPT-PAGE. 
     MOVE RPT-PAGE TO R01-70.
     DISPLAY RPT-L01 UPON PRINTER. 
     MOVE RPT-DATEP TO R02-70.
     DISPLAY RPT-L02 UPON PRINTER. 
     DISPLAY RPT-L03 UPON PRINTER. 
     DISPLAY RPT-L04 UPON PRINTER. 
     MOVE 4 TO RPT-LINES.
 RPT-DETAIL.
     IF RPT-LINES > 6
         PERFORM RPT-FOOT
         PERFORM RPT-HEAD
     END-IF.
     ADD CUST-BAL TO RT-09.
     MOVE CUST-NAME TO R05-05.
     MOVE CUST-BAL TO R05-30.
     DISPLAY RPT-L05 UPON PRINTER. 
     ADD 1 TO RPT-LINES.
 RPT-FOOT.
     PERFORM RPT-SKIP UNTIL RPT-LINES > 6.
     MOVE RT-09 TO R08-30.
     DISPLAY RPT-L08 UPON PRINTER. 
     ADD 1 TO RPT-LINES.
     PERFORM RPT-SKIP UNTIL RPT-LINES > 65.
 RPT-SKIP.
     DISPLAY " " UPON PRINTER. 
     ADD 1 TO RPT-LINES. 
 RPT-END.
     PERFORM RPT-FOOT.
